{"seq":2,"slug":"sampling-frame-stratified-collection","title":"采样框构建与分层抽样采集机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/corpus-linguistics-language-resource-engineering/corpus-design-representativeness-model/sampling-frame-stratified-collection","wordCount":2867,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"采样框构建与分层抽样采集机制\">采样框构建与分层抽样采集机制</h1><p>当你决定&quot;要建一个 10 亿词的英语新闻语料&quot;时，第一个真问题不是爬多少页，而是<strong>你从哪里知道&quot;英语新闻&quot;总共有哪些成员</strong>。这个&quot;从哪里知道&quot;就是采样框（sampling frame）。没有采样框，样本量再大也只是方便样本（convenience sample）——它能告诉你&quot;我抓到了什么&quot;，但回答不了&quot;没抓到的那部分长什么样&quot;。本文拆解采样框的界定方式、分层变量的选择与配比公式，以及从爬取到入库的工程流水线如何把分层落到可执行的采集规则上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>语料库建设里存在<strong>三个不同的&quot;总体&quot;</strong>，混淆它们是绝大多数代表性事故的根源：目标总体（target population，你想推断的那片语言使用）、框总体（frame population，采样框能枚举到的成员）、以及实际样本。三者两两之间的差就是偏差的来源。Biber 在 1993 年的奠基论文里把&quot;代表性&quot;重新定义为&quot;样本对研究者关心的语言维度分布的覆盖程度&quot;，而不是样本自身的属性（Biber, <em>Representativeness in corpus design</em>, Literary and Linguistic Computing 8(4): 243–257, 1993）。这一定义把问题从&quot;够不够大&quot;转向&quot;维度覆盖得全不全&quot;。</p>\n<p>分层抽样（stratified sampling）的机制是：用一个与目标变量相关的辅助变量把框总体切成互斥的层（stratum），层内抽样、层间按权重合并。它比简单随机抽样精度更高，前提是层内同质、层间异质。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[研究问题] --&gt; B[界定目标总体]&#10;  B --&gt; C[构建采样框]&#10;  C --&gt; D[选择分层变量]&#10;  D --&gt; E[层内抽样单元]&#10;  E --&gt; F[加权合并与估计]&#10;  F --&gt; G[偏倚诊断]&#10;  G --&gt;|覆盖不足| C&#10;  G --&gt;|配比失衡| D\">graph TD\n  A[研究问题] --&gt; B[界定目标总体]\n  B --&gt; C[构建采样框]\n  C --&gt; D[选择分层变量]\n  D --&gt; E[层内抽样单元]\n  E --&gt; F[加权合并与估计]\n  F --&gt; G[偏倚诊断]\n  G --&gt;|覆盖不足| C\n  G --&gt;|配比失衡| D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>采样框类型</th>\n<th>典型来源</th>\n<th>覆盖误差方向</th>\n<th>相对成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可枚举清单</td>\n<td>出版书目、报刊目录、字幕库索引</td>\n<td>低，但有登记滞后</td>\n<td>高（人工维护）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜爬图（crawl graph）</td>\n<td>Common Crawl URL 索引</td>\n<td>系统性漏掉长尾与深网</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索索引</td>\n<td>商用搜索引擎结果页</td>\n<td>受排序与个性化污染</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>种子扩展</td>\n<td>种子 URL + 链接跟随</td>\n<td>依赖种子质量，易闭环</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已有语料再抽样</td>\n<td>BNC、COCA、CCL 等</td>\n<td>继承上游选择偏倚</td>\n<td>很低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"采样框的界定与覆盖误差\">采样框的界定与覆盖误差</h2><p>调查方法学把误差拆成覆盖误差（coverage error）、抽样误差、无应答误差与测量误差。语料库的<strong>覆盖误差</strong>最容易被忽视，因为它不体现在任何一行代码里。网络语料的主流采样框是 Common Crawl（<a href=\"https://commoncrawl.org/）的月度\">https://commoncrawl.org/）的月度</a> URL 索引：它每月爬取数十亿网页，但本质是&quot;被其他页面链接到的&quot;这一代理——深度超过若干跳的页面、需要登录或交互才能到达的内容、以及极少被外链的中小站点，会被系统性地排除在外。这就是典型的<strong>未覆盖（undercoverage）</strong>。反向的**过覆盖（overcoverage）**同样存在：镜像页、聚合站、模板生成的 SEO 垃圾页会以极高比例进入框总体，稀释真实语言使用。</p>\n<p>一个可操作的纪律是：把采样框写成一个可复现的<strong>三元组</strong>——发现机制（discovery mechanism）+ 时间窗（crawl window）+ 过滤规则（filter rules）。例如&quot;以 Common Crawl 2026 年 3—5 月索引为发现机制，仅保留 <code>.uk</code> 与英国报刊白名单域名，时间窗为该索引的抓取时刻，过滤掉正文少于 200 词的页面&quot;。三元组缺任何一项，别人都无法复现你的框，也无法判断覆盖误差的方向。</p>\n<p>中文语料常见的框有北京语言大学语料库中心（BCC）的网页抓取、CCL 语料库的报刊子库，以及各类公众号/论坛导出。它们的覆盖特征差异很大，选择时必须显式声明，而不是默认所有&quot;中文网页&quot;等价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分层变量的选择与配比\">分层变量的选择与配比</h2><p>分层变量必须满足两个经验条件：与目标变量的分布相关，且层内相对同质。文本语料最常用的分层维度是<strong>体裁/语域（register）、领域（domain）、时间（period）、地理或语言变体、媒介（口语 vs 书面 vs 计算机中介传播）、作者人口学</strong>。Biber、Conrad 与 Reppen 在 1998 年的《Corpus Linguistics: Investigating Language Structure and Use》里提出的&quot;矩阵设计&quot;就是用 register × dialect × time 的交叉格作为层。</p>\n<p>配比（allocation）决定了每层抽多少。设共 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 层，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 层的总体规模为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、层内标准差为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，总样本量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>比例配比（proportional）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_h = n \\cdot \\frac{N_h}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2392em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8942em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4159em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。层越大抽得越多，估计总体均值时自加权，实现最简单。</li>\n<li><strong>奈曼最优配比（Neyman）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>H</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_h = n \\cdot \\frac{N_h S_h}{\\sum_{j=1}^{H} N_j S_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6461em;vertical-align:-0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8942em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5703em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8852em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1786em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8971em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4603em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4159em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。变异越大的层抽得越多，在给定总样本量下方差最小。</li>\n<li><strong>等量配比（equal）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_h = n / H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>。牺牲总体估计效率，换取层间比较的统计功效——研究&quot;口语 vs 书面&quot;差异时常用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>现实语料往往是<strong>有意偏离比例</strong>的。英国国家语料库（BNC，约 1 亿词、4 000 余篇文本）在设计上对口语向上过采样，使口语占比显著高于其在真实语言使用中的比例，目的是保证口语层的比较功效。美国当代英语语料库（COCA，约 10 亿词）则把口语、小说、杂志、报纸、学术五个体裁大致等量处理，每体裁约两亿词。<strong>过采样不是缺陷，前提是你在文档里写明权重</strong>——比例配比与过采样完全是两套估计口径，混用就会得出错误的总频率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从爬取到入库-分层采集的工程流水线\">从爬取到入库：分层采集的工程流水线</h2><p>分层只有落成流水线上的可执行步骤才算数。大规模文本采集的标准流水线是&quot;发现 → 抽取 → 过滤 → 去重 → 标注 → 分层配比 → 入库&quot;。每一环节都会改变层的实际构成。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>启发式过滤</strong>：T5 的 C4 语料用行末标点、去 boilerplate、去 bad words 等规则从 Common Crawl 得到约 806 GB、约 1 560 亿 token（Raffel et al., <em>Exploring the Limits of Transfer Learning with a Unified Text-to-Text Transformer</em>, JMLR 2020, arXiv:1910.10683）。</li>\n<li><strong>多子集拼合</strong>：The Pile 把 22 个子数据集拼成 825 GiB，每个子集本质是一个显式的&quot;层&quot;，权重由设计者指定（Gao et al., 2020, arXiv:2101.00027）。</li>\n<li><strong>开放治理语料</strong>：Dolma 提供约 3 万亿 token，并附带语言、质量、毒性等 tagger 产出的<strong>分层元数据</strong>，使下游可以按层再配比（Soldaini et al., ACL 2024）。</li>\n<li><strong>质量分层</strong>：HuggingFace 的 FineWeb 约 15 万亿 token，其中 FineWeb-Edu 用模型打分筛出约 1.3 万亿&quot;教育质量&quot;token；DCLM 则在 DataComp-LM 基准上用 model-based quality filter 分出约 4 万亿 token（arXiv:2406.11794）。这两个工作把&quot;质量&quot;本身变成了一个分层变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S[分层变量定义] --&gt; D[发现层: crawl / 清单 / 种子]&#10;  D --&gt; X[正文抽取 per stratum]&#10;  X --&gt; F[语言与质量过滤]&#10;  F --&gt; K[去重: 精确 + 近似]&#10;  K --&gt; T[元数据标注: 语言/体裁/时间/质量]&#10;  T --&gt; A[按层配比采样]&#10;  A --&gt; W[权重与来源记录]&#10;  W --&gt; R[(入库 + 数据卡)]\">flowchart TD\n  S[分层变量定义] --&gt; D[发现层: crawl / 清单 / 种子]\n  D --&gt; X[正文抽取 per stratum]\n  X --&gt; F[语言与质量过滤]\n  F --&gt; K[去重: 精确 + 近似]\n  K --&gt; T[元数据标注: 语言/体裁/时间/质量]\n  T --&gt; A[按层配比采样]\n  A --&gt; W[权重与来源记录]\n  W --&gt; R[(入库 + 数据卡)]</pre><p>注意流水线的顺序效应：先过滤后配比与先配比后过滤会得到不同的层构成。若质量过滤对某一层（如口语转写）的淘汰率远高于其他层，则&quot;名义上的比例配比&quot;在过滤后已经不再是比例配比。工程上的做法是把过滤器的分层淘汰率也记录下来，作为配比校正的输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"样本量与设计效应\">样本量与设计效应</h2><p>&quot;语料是不是越大越好&quot;是一个可以量化的经验问题。Biber 在 1990 年的方法论讨论中提出**饱和（saturation）**概念：当新增样本不再引入新的语言特征类型时，样本对该维度即达到饱和。词型—词例的增长可用 Heaps 定律近似：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mi>β</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = K \\cdot n^{\\beta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 为词型数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为词例数，英语语料里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 常落在 0.4 至 0.6 之间。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 意味着词表随规模增长而递减——这解释了为什么从 1 亿词扩到 10 亿词，新词型增益远小于十倍。</p>\n<p>更关键的是<strong>设计效应（design effect）</strong>。语料抽样常以&quot;文档&quot;为抽样单元，但语言特征在文档内部高度相关（同一作者、同一话题），这就是聚类抽样：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DEFF</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mtext>DEFF</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DEFF} = 1 + (m - 1)\\rho, \\qquad n_{\\text{eff}} = \\frac{n}{\\text{DEFF}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DEFF</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DEFF</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 为每层平均文档数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 为层内相关系数（ICC）。若一篇 1 万词的文档内部 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span>、每层 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m = 50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> 篇，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DEFF</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>15.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DEFF} \\approx 15.7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DEFF</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15.7</span></span></span></span></span>——名义上 50 万词的层，其有效独立信息量只相当于三万词左右。这直接说明<strong>多抽文档、每篇少抽词</strong>通常优于<strong>少抽文档、每篇多抽词</strong>，因为前者的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 更低。样本量预算应该在层内文档数与单文档长度之间分配，而不是只堆总词数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"采集偏倚的检测与治理\">采集偏倚的检测与治理</h2><p>偏倚的检测是一个分布对比问题：把样本的分层元数据分布与框总体的分布对齐，用卡方检验或 KL 散度量化偏离：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>KL</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>h</mi></munder><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{KL}}(P \\,\\|\\, Q) = \\sum_{h} P(h) \\log \\frac{P(h)}{Q(h)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">KL</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7291em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 为框总体分布、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 为样本分布。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>KL</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{KL}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">KL</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越大，说明某些层被系统性稀释或放大。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>偏倚类型</th>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>缓解手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语言/地域偏倚</td>\n<td>英语占比远超真实使用</td>\n<td>语言识别后按层再平衡（Dolma、FineWeb 均做此步）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间偏倚</td>\n<td>快照只反映抓取时刻</td>\n<td>显式记录 crawl date，按时段分层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体裁偏倚</td>\n<td>百科/论坛占比过高</td>\n<td>用体裁分类器分层，对稀缺体裁过采样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量偏倚</td>\n<td>模型打分淘汰了方言与口语</td>\n<td>保留低分层的对照样本，记录分层淘汰率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复偏倚</td>\n<td>镜像与聚合站反复进入</td>\n<td>精确哈希 + MinHash 近似去重（去除近重复率可达数十个百分点）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>治理的最后一步是<strong>来源记录</strong>。Gebru 等人提出的数据卡（Datasheets for Datasets, <em>Communications of the ACM</em>, 2021）要求数据集声明动机、构成、采集过程、预处理、用途与分发方式——对语料而言，其中的&quot;采集过程&quot;正是本文讨论的采样框与分层配比。此外，采集必须遵守目标站点的 robots.txt 与适用的数据保护法规，采样框的覆盖范围不能以绕过访问控制为代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>采样框是代表性的前提</strong>：目标总体、框总体、样本三者之差决定了偏倚方向；框写成&quot;发现机制 + 时间窗 + 过滤规则&quot;三元组才可复现。</li>\n<li><strong>分层要有理由</strong>：分层变量须与目标分布相关且层内同质；常用维度是体裁、领域、时间、变体、媒介。</li>\n<li><strong>配比公式决定效率</strong>：比例配比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>∝</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_h \\propto N_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、奈曼配比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>∝</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_h \\propto N_h S_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、等量配比各有适用场景；过采样要显式记录权重。</li>\n<li><strong>规模不是唯一答案</strong>：Heaps 定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 说明新词型递减；设计效应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DEFF</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DEFF} = 1 + (m-1)\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DEFF</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 说明多抽文档优于多堆词数。</li>\n<li><strong>偏倚要检测也要治理</strong>：分布对比量化偏离，去重与再平衡缓解偏倚，数据卡保证采集过程可审计。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本 hub 的下一章将处理样本抽出来之后的标注问题——分层设计如何决定标注抽样方案、以及标注一致性如何被层内相关所影响，见 <a href=\"../annotation-schema-agreement/\">标注模式与一致性</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"采样框构建与分层抽样采集机制","id":"采样框构建与分层抽样采集机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"采样框的界定与覆盖误差","id":"采样框的界定与覆盖误差"},{"level":2,"text":"分层变量的选择与配比","id":"分层变量的选择与配比"},{"level":2,"text":"从爬取到入库：分层采集的工程流水线","id":"从爬取到入库-分层采集的工程流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"样本量与设计效应","id":"样本量与设计效应"},{"level":2,"text":"采集偏倚的检测与治理","id":"采集偏倚的检测与治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"语料库类型分类与平衡性设计模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/corpus-linguistics-language-resource-engineering/corpus-design-representativeness-model/corpus-type-taxonomy-balance"},"next":{"title":"代表性度量与语料偏置审计实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/corpus-linguistics-language-resource-engineering/corpus-design-representativeness-model/representativeness-bias-audit"}}